In summary, despite their brilliant performance in various practical applications, MOF/COF composites still face many challenges, and it is hoped that this review will contribute to some of the research in this field. In general, with the continuous efforts of researchers and the development of synthetic chemistry, MOF/COF composites will have broader application prospects in the future.
